    "a change is worth the loop at all. Run it on a change with no independent source of truth to assert against and you get a test that restates the implementation — the tautological anti-pattern the skill itself warns about, arrived at from the other direction. It is": "一个改动是否值得走这个循环。在一个没有独立真相来源可断言的改动上运行它，你会得到一个复述实现的测试——正是该技能自己警告过的同义反复反模式，只是从另一个方向到达。它是",
