    "A fair and repeated criticism. Two things help. Pass the argument — tell it what the next session is for — so the reasoning that bears on": "一个公正且被反复提出的批评。有两件事有帮助。传入参数——告诉它下一个会话是干什么的——这样与",
    "A fair complaint, filed as an open issue arguing that most of the routing is deterministic and the narrative makes it hard to scan. Nothing stops you asking for the compressed form — \"just give me the sequence\" gets you the sequence. What the prose is carrying is the conditional half: the branches, where a human decision is expected, and where to clear or compact between steps. A flat checklist drops exactly that.": "一个公正的抱怨，已作为开放 issue 提交，认为大部分路由是确定性的，而叙事式描述难以快速浏览。没有什么阻止你索要压缩形式——「直接给我序列」就会得到序列。散文承载的是条件那一半：分支、哪里期望人类决策、以及在哪一步之间该清空或压缩。扁平的清单恰恰丢掉了这些。",
