    "A request that was rejected six months ago comes back, and it says so and quotes the old reason instead of triaging it fresh.": "六个月前被拒绝的请求又回来了，它说明情况并引用旧理由，而不是重新分流。",
    "A rough idea of your own, nothing written down": "你自己一个粗略的想法，什么也没写下来",
