    "Every URL is opened before the value from that page is asked for. You're never asked to paste something you haven't been sent to fetch.": "每个 URL 都会在被索要页面上的值之前打开。你永远不会被要求粘贴自己没被派去取的东西。",
    "Everything a caller must know to use it correctly: the type signature, plus invariants, ordering constraints, error modes, required config, performance characteristics.": "调用者正确使用它必须知道的一切：类型签名，以及不变量、顺序约束、错误模式、所需配置、性能特征。",
