    "Into the conversation only. This is the most substantive open complaint about the skill: the glossary is not a spec, most answers do not earn an ADR, and there is no ledger tying each resolved answer through to a spec, a ticket and a test. Precise answers — ordering guarantees, negative requirements, numeric defaults — get softened into weaker prose downstream, and the result can look complete while missing the thing you actually decided. The mitigation available today is to keep the session and feed it straight to": "只进入对话。这是对该技能最实质性的公开抱怨：词汇表不是规格说明，大多数答案不值得写 ADR，也没有账本把每个已解决的答案串联到规格说明、任务和测试。精确的答案——顺序保证、否定性需求、数值默认值——在下游被软化成更弱的散文，结果可能看起来很完整，却漏掉了你真正决定的东西。今天可用的缓解措施是保留会话，直接把它喂给",
