    "It refuses to treat a conflict as a text problem. Before touching a hunk it traces each side back to its": "它拒绝把冲突当作文本问题。在触碰一个块之前，它把每一方追溯回它的",
    "It refuses to write an ADR for something you could undo tomorrow — and says which of the three tests failed.": "它拒绝为你明天就能撤销的事情写 ADR——并说出三项测试中哪一项失败了。",
    "It runs two more checks against the codebase in the same pass —": "它在同一次扫描中对代码库再跑两项检查——",
    "It shows you a command and its red output before it offers a single theory. If theory arrives first, the skill is not running.": "它先给你看一条命令和它的红色输出，然后才提出任何理论。如果理论先到，说明技能没有在运行。",
    "It shrinks the repro before it starts guessing, and can tell you why each remaining piece is load-bearing.": "它先缩小复现，再开始猜测，并能告诉你为什么每个剩余部分是承重的。",
    "It sits outside the build loop — it is not a step in the main loop but something you run periodically to queue up more work to improve the codebase. The four situations it gets used in:": "它坐在构建循环之外——它不是主循环上的一步，而是你定期运行以排队更多改进代码库工作的东西。它的四种使用情境：",
