    "No. Wayfinder's tickets are decision tickets, and by the time the map closes they are all closed too. What is left is a map full of linked decisions, which is not a build plan.": "不。Wayfinder 的任务是决策任务，地图关闭时它们也都关闭了。剩下的是满是关联决策的地图，它不是构建计划。",
    "Nobody is happy with the name. There is an open suggestion to rename it": "没人喜欢这个名字。有一个开放的改名建议",
    "Nobody's head yet — the question needs something to react to": "还没有人脑中——问题需要可回应的东西",
    "None of the above. The default, and it lands here often": "以上都不是。默认情况，而且经常落在这里",
    "None to generate one. The wizard it writes runs on bash, and uses": "生成它无需任何前置。它写的 wizard 在 bash 上运行，并使用",
