    "Rarely, and you should know that going in. The skill is built to output findings, so the framing pushes it toward producing candidates rather than concluding that nothing is wrong. The strength badges are the defence — a report where everything is": "很少，而且你应该在开始前就知道。技能为输出发现而构建，所以框架推动它产出候选，而不是得出「一切正常」的结论。强度徽章就是防御——一份所有内容都是",
