    "Reach for it as soon as you have an idea worth taking seriously — a feature, a product direction, a business call, a piece of writing — and long before you have worked out what it involves. Vagueness is not a reason to wait; it is the thing the session eats. If you can already specify the thing precisely, you don't need to grill it.": "一有值得认真对待的想法就用它——一个功能、一个产品方向、一个商业决策、一篇文章——远在你弄清楚它涉及什么之前。模糊不是等待的理由；它正是会话要吃掉的东西。如果你已经能精确地说明那个东西，你就不需要审问它。",
    "Reach for it at the start of a change, in a repo, when the plan is still fuzzy and the words for the thing are not settled yet. It is the single-session tool. Which grilling skill you want depends on what is in front of you:": "在改动开始时使用它，在仓库中，当计划仍然模糊、事物的用词尚未敲定时。它是单会话工具。你想要哪个审问技能取决于你面前是什么：",
    "Reach for it by hand for everything else an agent reads: your docs, specs and": "其余智能体阅读的一切，都手动使用它：你的文档、规格说明和",
    "Reach for it on the hard ones: a bug that resists a first look, an intermittent flake, a regression that crept in between two known-good states. It is heavy by design, and the wrong tool for a question you want answered in one message.": "在难啃的上面使用它：第一眼看不透的 bug、间歇性偶发、在两个已知良好状态之间悄悄溜进来的回归。它按设计就很重，对你想一条消息得到答案的问题来说是错误的工具。",
    "Reach for it once per repo, before the first use of any other engineering skill. If": "每个仓库使用一次，在任何其他工程技能首次使用之前。如果",
    "Reach for it the moment you hit a question you can't settle by talking — a state machine whose edge cases you can't hold in your head, a screen you can't picture until you see three versions side by side.": "一遇到无法靠讨论解决的问题就用它——一个边界情况装不进脑子的状态机、一个要看到三个版本并排才能想象的屏幕。",
    "Reach for it when": "当",
    "Reach for it when a decision is blocked on knowledge that lives in one other person's head: a client, a domain expert, an exec who owns the business rules, a colleague on a team you don't sit with. Which skill you want depends on where the answers actually are:": "当一个决策被只存在于另一个人脑中的知识阻塞时使用它：客户、领域专家、掌握业务规则的高管、不在你团队的同事。你想要哪个技能取决于答案实际在哪里：",
    "Reach for it when git has already stopped on conflicts it could not resolve itself. It is scoped to the conflict in front of you, not to anything either side of it:": "当 git 已经停在它无法自行解决的冲突上时使用它。它限定在你面前的冲突，不涉及它任何一侧的东西：",
    "Reach for it when the": "当",
