    "Throwaway code to answer a design question, not chase a defect": "回答设计问题的一次性代码，不是追查缺陷",
    "Throwaway is a constraint on how the code is": "一次性是对代码「如何」的约束",
    "throws that collapse away.": "扔掉那个折叠。",
    "ticket only resolves through the live exchange; an agent that answers its own": "任务只能通过实时往来解决；一个自问自答的智能体",
    "Tickets": "任务",
    "Tickets that": "那些",
    "Tight": "紧密",
    "to a teaching workspace, learn it there with": "到一个教学工作区，在那里用",
    "to borrow its vocabulary is a one-line habit any skill can do; this skill is for when you are": "借用它的词汇是任何技能都能做到的一行习惯；这个技能是为当你",
    "to build. When you're unsure which skill or flow fits,": "构建。当你不确定哪个技能或流程合适时，",
    "to change is a scoping smell.": "要改动的东西，是范围界定上的坏味道。",
