    "With the next thing you are building in mind. Where a big build is coming up, point it at the spec and ask \"how can we make this change easy?\" An unprompted run scans for hot spots on its own, which is fine for routine upkeep, but naming a direction is what makes the report actionable.": "心里想着你接下来要构建的东西。当大型构建即将到来时，把它指向规格说明并问「怎样才能让这个改动变得容易？」没有提示的运行会自行扫描热点，对日常维护没问题，但点名方向才让报告可执行。",
