    "— one run produces one document for one person.": "——一次运行为一个人生成一份文档。",
    "— the questions are a flat, grouped list, not a tree that skips section D if you answered A. And it isn't": "——问题是一个扁平的、分组列表，而不是一棵「答 A 就跳过 D 节」的树。而且它不是",
    "— the whole frontier at once, then recomputed from your answers — so the \"give me all the questions at once\" need is met there.": "——一次给出整个前沿，然后根据你的回答重新计算——所以「一次给我所有问题」的需求在那里被满足。",
    "— you lack the context, the recipient holds it — and that framing drives its shape:": "——你缺少上下文，接收者持有它——而正是这个框架决定了它的形态：",
    ", and publishes it to your issue tracker as a single issue.": "，并把结果作为单个 issue 发布到你的 issue 追踪器。",
    "— skip the spec": "——跳过规格说明",
    "— the shape of the solution, the choices you argued through, what you deliberately refused — is in one conversation that is about to be cleared. The spec is what survives that.": "——解决方案的形状、你争论过的选择、你刻意拒绝的东西——都在一段即将被清空的对话里。规格说明正是从那里幸存下来的。",
    ", and it is worse on Codex than on Claude.": "，而且在 Codex 上比在 Claude 上更糟。",
