    ". A common split is Linear for issues and planning, GitHub for code and PRs: skills that say \"issue tracker\" map to Linear, skills that say \"PR\" map to GitHub. On the local-markdown tracker there is an open template bug where the generated file can carry the acceptance criteria twice, once at the top level and once inside the agent brief (": "。常见的分工是：issue 和规划用 Linear，代码和 PR 用 GitHub：说「issue 追踪器」的技能映射到 Linear，说「PR」的技能映射到 GitHub。本地 markdown 追踪器上有一个开放的模板 bug：生成的文件可能携带两份验收标准，一份在顶层，一份在智能体简报里（",
    "— a category role and a state role — and leaving behind either an agent-ready brief, a specific question for the reporter, or a closed issue with a recorded reason.": "——一个类别角色和一个状态角色——并留下以下之一：一份智能体就绪的简报、一个给报告人的具体问题，或一个记录了原因的关闭 issue。",
    "— it's a built feature, not a rejected one, and filing it there would poison the dedup checks.": "——它是已构建的功能，不是被否决的，把它归档到那里会毒化去重检查。",
    "— you pick one, and then it gathers full": "——你选定一个，然后它收集完整的",
    ", not \"that last message\". What lost you is usually bigger than one paragraph, so the agent decides how far back to go.": "，而不是「最后那条消息」。让你跟丢的东西通常比一个段落更大，所以智能体决定回溯多远。",
    ". \"Be concise\" is an instruction about the agent's output, and the model obeys it by clipping words and losing you further.": "。「要简洁」是关于智能体输出的指令，而模型通过删词来服从它，让你更迷路。",
    ". ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English sets the register. The ubiquitous language supplies the nouns. The skill,": "。ASD-STE100 简化技术英语定下语域。通用语言提供名词。技能，",
    ", and it is the rule agents break most often. When the map clears, wayfinder hands off; it does not carry on into code.": "，而这是智能体违反最多的规则。当地图清空时，wayfinder 交接；它不会继续进入代码。",
    ", and put a plain-language instruction in your global": "，并把一条平实语言的指令放进你的全局",
